# Profile UX

Use the shared profile system in `src/modules/shared/profile/`. See `docs/ux/PROFILE-SYSTEM.md`.

## Three modes only

| Mode | When | Density |
|------|------|---------|
| **Full** | Show pages (`ClientShow`, `ContactShow`, …) | Header + tabs + Related |
| **Preview** | Hub sheets (Accounts `?company` / `?contact`) | Header + compact tabs |
| **Context** | Workspace side panels (Messages, Tickets, Project) | Compact identity card + “View profile” |

Do **not** invent a fourth ad-hoc mini-profile.

## Rules

1. Compose `EntityIdentityHeader` / `EntityMetaRow` / context cards — do not fork markup per module.
2. One fact per role: identity in header; work in tabs; entity jumps in Related.
3. Never show the same channel as both text and icon (e.g. website URL under name **and** Globe icon).
4. No audit timestamps (`Created`) in scan headers — Edit / overflow menu only.
5. Location strings must be complete when address fields exist (`formatCompanyLocation`).
6. Related must not mirror a center tab’s primary list (e.g. no Projects in Related if Projects is a tab).
7. Preview ⊂ Full; Context embeds the same identity block. Open Full/Preview via `routing.ts` helpers.
8. Product UI copy stays English (see `english-ui` rule).
